==Trivia==
* This was the last volume to be published of [[VIZ Media]]'s original first edition of [[Pokémon Adventures]]. While publication of the second edition of Pokémon Adventures began in 2009, the first all-new volume would not be released until {{PAV|8}} in August 2010, closing the longest gap between releases to occur in their publication of the series.

===Translation edits===
====VIZ Media second edition====
*{{p|Jynx}}'s color is changed from black, to a lighter color, presumably purple, to reflect [[Pokémon controversies#Racism|Jynx's recoloring]].
*One line of dialogue has been changed from the original release, a scene where Lorelei asks {{Adv|Green}} the reason behind her 'suicidal actions' has been changed to 'irrational actions'.

